          "worked": "Replace $x$ by $\\frac{x}{h}$ and $y$ by $\\frac{y}{k}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2}{h^2}+\\frac{y^3}{k^3}&=1\\\\\\frac{8x^2}{h^2}+\\frac{8y^3}{k^3}&=8\\end{align*}$$\n\nMatching coefficients gives $h^2=8$ and $k^3=8$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}h&=\\sqrt{8}\\\\h&=2\\sqrt{2}\\\\k&=2\\end{align*}$$",
