          "worked": "Replace $x$ by $\\frac{x}{h}$ and $y$ by $\\frac{y}{k}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^4}{h^4}-\\frac{y^2}{k^2}&=1\\\\\\frac{81x^4}{h^4}-\\frac{81y^2}{k^2}&=81\\end{align*}$$\n\nMatching coefficients gives $h^4=81$ and $k^2=81$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}h&=\\sqrt[4]{81}\\\\h&=3\\\\k&=9\\end{align*}$$",
